This package integrates with two official Swiss federal registries:

    Zefix (Central Business Names Index), Federal Office of Justice
    https://www.zefix.admin.ch

    UID register, Federal Statistical Office
    https://www.uid.admin.ch
    Webservice specification: https://dam-api.bfs.admin.ch/hub/api/dam/assets/24605175/master

What this package implements is the publicly documented request and response
contracts of those two webservices: endpoints, parameters, field names and
their meaning, and the eCH-0097 UID check-digit algorithm. That documentation
is published openly by the Federal Office of Justice and the Federal
Statistical Office for the purpose of being integrated against.

No proprietary source code was copied from either administration, and this
package is an independent implementation. It is not affiliated with, nor
endorsed by, the Swiss federal administration, Zefix or the UID register.

The acknowledgement is made because that is where the data and the interface
contracts come from, and because attribution is owed whether or not any
licence compels it here.
